  "name": "Pineapple Upside-Down Cake",
  "subtitle": "A tender butter cake with caramelized pineapple and cranberries",
  "description": "Fresh pineapple and cranberries bake beneath a soft vanilla-almond cake, then become the topping when the cake is inverted.",
